  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Previously, Arkady and young Lyosha had fun playing war games in the communal corridor. Meanwhile, at Ivan Samsonov's flat, Ivan returns home after three days away and asks his family to support him at the upcoming televised mayoral debate.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
