  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Ты сам виноват в своих бедах.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's see how Ivan's plea for family loyalty falls completely flat.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Привет, семья! Я вернулся домой.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Hello, family! I returned home.' Ivan tries to greet everyone cheerfully after disappearing.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Ох, живой! Надо же!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Oh, alive! Well, I never!' Nina's sarcastic exclamation greets his unexpected return.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Тебя три дня дома не было!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You were not home for three days!' The 'of' form follows the negative past construction.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Я ночами совсем не спала.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I did not sleep at all at night.' The 'with'-form plural expresses the time when something happened.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я просто взял короткую паузу.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I simply took a short break.' Ivan offers a weak excuse for his long drinking binge.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Завтра вечером у меня дебаты.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Tomorrow evening I have a debate.' The adverbial phrase establishes the upcoming event.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Мне очень нужна поддержка семьи.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I really need the family's support.' The short adjective expresses necessity in the 'to/for' form construction.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Как же я туда пойду?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'How on earth will I go there?' The emphatic particle conveys Nina's strong reluctance.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Я же тебя сейчас ненавижу!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I hate you right now!' Nina bluntly refuses to stand by his side in public.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Дети, а вы пойдёте со мной?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Children, and will you go with me?' Ivan turns to his offspring hoping for loyalty.",
   "gap": 0.4
