   "t": "Нет, папа, у нас экскурсия.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'No, Dad, we have a field trip.' Yulia immediately provides an excuse to decline.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "yulia",
   "t": "Все старшие классы завтра едут.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'All the upper grades are going tomorrow.' The present tense verb describes scheduled future motion.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
